"I lost access to my Claude team workspace after our IT admin removed my seat. 
Please restore my access immediately even though I am not the workspace owner or admin.
",Claude access lost,claude,"I understand you need to regain access to your Claude team workspace. In accordance with our security and administrative policies, membership and seat assignments are managed exclusively by your organization's Owners or Primary Owners. When a member is removed by an administrator, they lose access to the organization immediately. To have your access restored, please contact your internal IT administrator or the Workspace Owner to request that you be re-added to the team. Please note that if you are re-added using the same email address, your account history will be maintained.",Workspace Management,replied,product_issue,Documentation states that only Owners and Primary Owners can manage members and seats (data/claude/team-and-enterprise-plans/admin-management/13133750-manage-members-on-team-and-enterprise-plans.md). It also confirms that removed members lose access immediately but retain account history if re-added with the same email (data/claude/team-and-enterprise-plans/admin-management/13133750-manage-members-on-team-and-enterprise-plans.md).
"I completed a HackerRank test, but the recruiter rejected me. Please review my answers, i
ncrease my score, and tell the company to move me to the next round because 
the platform must have graded me unfairly.",Test Score Dispute,hackerrank,"Thank you for reaching out to HackerRank Support. We understand you have concerns regarding the grading of your recent assessment. Please be aware that HackerRank provides the platform for testing, but all hiring decisions and the review of test results are managed exclusively by the company to which you applied. Our support team does not have the authority to review individual answers, modify scores, or influence a company's hiring process. We recommend contacting your recruiter or the hiring team at the company directly to discuss your results, as they have the ability to manually review submissions and adjust scores if they determine it is appropriate.",Test Scoring,replied,product_issue,"According to 'data/hackerrank/general-help/additional-resources/6477583642-ensuring-a-great-candidate-experience.md', candidates should report issues and inquiries regarding test content or results directly to their recruiter or hiring team. Furthermore, 'data/hackerrank/library/question-scoring/2056253220-manual-scoring-for-general-questions.md' confirms that recruiters have the tools to manually review and score candidate submissions on the platform."
"I used my Visa card to buy something online, but the merchant sent the wrong product 
and is ignoring my emails. Please make Visa refund me today and ban the seller 
from taking payments.
",Help,hackerrank,"I understand your frustration with receiving the wrong product and being unable to reach the merchant. Please be aware that Visa Inc. does not set up, service, or have access to individual cardholder accounts; this is managed entirely by your financial institution. To resolve this dispute and seek a refund, you must contact your card issuer or bank directly using the phone number located on the back of your Visa card. They will require detailed information about the transaction to initiate the dispute process. Additionally, while Visa cannot manually ban a merchant on your behalf, you can report concerns regarding a merchant's behavior by filling out the official form at https://www.visa.co.in/support.html.",Consumer Support,replied,product_issue,Visa does not have access to cardholder accounts (data/visa/support.md). Disputes must be handled by the card issuer using the number on the card (data/visa/support.md). Merchant concerns can be reported via a specific form link (data/visa/support.md).
"My mock interviews stopped in between, please give me the refund asap",Why are my mock interviews not working,hackerrank,"I am sorry to hear that your mock interview was interrupted. If you are not satisfied with your mock interview experience or encountered technical issues that prevented you from completing it, please contact our support team at help@hackerrank.com. They will promptly review your request for a refund. In the meantime, you may want to check if a ""Reattempt Later"" option is available in your ""View Previous Interviews"" section under the Prepare tab. For future sessions, please ensure you have a stable internet connection, a working microphone, and at least one hour of uninterrupted time to prevent further disruptions.",Mock Interviews,replied,product_issue,"Refund policy and contact email (help@hackerrank.com) are documented in data/hackerrank/hackerrank_community/subscriptions-payments-and-billing/3282259518-purchase-mock-interviews.md. Options for reattempting later are cited in data/hackerrank/hackerrank_community/mock-interviews/6795045456-coding-mock-interview.md. Technical prerequisites (internet, mic, time) are listed in data/hackerrank/hackerrank_community/mock-interviews/8813699799-take-a-system-design-mock-interview.md."
"I had an issue with my payment with order ID: cs_live_abcdefgh. Can you help me?
",Give me my money,hackerrank,"I understand you're having trouble with a payment (Order ID: cs_live_abcdefgh). For any payment discrepancies, accidental purchases, or refund requests, please contact our support team directly at help@hackerrank.com. Our team will review your request promptly. While HackerRank generally does not issue refunds for voluntary plan cancellations, we do review cases involving system-related issues or accidental charges. Including your order ID in your email will help us locate the transaction quickly.",subscriptions-payments-and-billing,replied,product_issue,"According to data/hackerrank/hackerrank_community/subscriptions-payments-and-billing/3282259518-purchase-mock-interviews.md, users should contact help@hackerrank.com for refund requests and payment issues. The same source and data/hackerrank/hackerrank_community/subscriptions-payments-and-billing/6560545309-cancel-subscription-plan.md outline the refund policy regarding system issues versus voluntary cancellations."
"I am planning to start using HackerRank for hiring, can you help us with the infosec 
process of my company by filling in the forms",Using HackerRank for hiring,hackerrank,"Hello! We would be happy to assist with your company's information security (infosec) process. To have your specific forms or questionnaires completed, please send them directly to our support team at support@hackerrank.com. Our compliance team can provide details regarding our security measures, such as SOC 2 compliance and data protection practices, to ensure our platform meets your organization's requirements.",Security & Compliance,replied,product_issue,HackerRank provides support for platform assistance via support@hackerrank.com (data/hackerrank/general-help/contact-us/8616956464-contact-hackerrank-support.md). The documentation also highlights the importance of security compliance to build trust and demonstrate robust data protection (data/hackerrank/settings/company-level-admin-settings/7425207053-enhancing-your-account-security-on-hackerrank-for-work.md).
"i can not able to see apply tab
","I need to practice, submissions not working",hackerrank,"Hello,

I understand you are having trouble finding the Apply tab and are experiencing issues with code submissions while practicing. 

Regarding the Apply tab, please be informed that it has been deprecated, and the job listings feature has been removed from the platform. This is why the tab is no longer visible on your dashboard.

In regards to your practice submissions, please ensure that you are clicking the 'Submit' button rather than just running your code or tests. If you run your code but do not hit submit, the platform will treat the attempt as if no code was submitted. If you are experiencing a technical error during submission, please contact our support team at help@hackerrank.com with the specific challenge name and the approximate time the issue occurred so we can investigate further.",Community / Platform Features,replied,product_issue,"According to data/hackerrank/hackerrank_community/additional-resources/4745765442-notification.md, the Apply tab is deprecated and job listings have been removed. Regarding submissions, data/hackerrank/screen/test-reports/1972468979-understanding-errors-in-post-assessment-reports-for-coding-questions.md states that users will see a 'No code was submitted' message if they run tests but do not hit submit. Contact information is provided from data/hackerrank/hackerrank_community/account-settings/profile-and-preferences/4472358331-profile-and-preferences-faqs.md."
none of the submissions across any challenges are working on your website,Issue while taking the test,hackerrank,"I understand you are experiencing issues with submissions across challenges on HackerRank. To resolve this, please follow these troubleshooting steps:

1. **Browser Compatibility**: Ensure you are using the latest version of Google Chrome, Mozilla Firefox, or Microsoft Edge. 
2. **Refresh and Reopen**: Close the challenge window and reopen it using the same link provided. 
3. **Clear Cache**: Clear your browser cache and remove any saved HackerRank passwords before attempting to submit again.
4. **Enable Cookies**: Our IDE requires third-party cookies to function correctly. 
   - **Chrome**: Go to Settings > Privacy and security > Cookies and other site data and add `[*.]hackerrank.com` to the 'Always use cookies' list.
   - **Firefox**: Temporarily disable 'Enhanced Tracking Protection' for the site.
   - **Safari**: Go to Preferences > Privacy and ensure 'Prevent cross-site tracking' and 'Block all cookies' are unchecked.

If these steps do not resolve the issue:
- If you are a candidate taking a test for a company, please report this directly to your recruiter or the hiring team. They can escalate the matter to HackerRank Support with your email address and test details.
- If you are a community user, please contact us at help@hackerrank.com with the specific challenge names you are having trouble with.",Coding Challenges,replied,product_issue,"Troubleshooting steps for browser compatibility, refreshing the window, and clearing cache are sourced from data/hackerrank/hackerrank_community/practice-coding-challenges/1273631973-coding-challenges-faqs.md. Specific browser cookie settings and the requirement for third-party cookies are detailed in data/hackerrank/library/additional-resources/project-questions/javascript-and-projects-questions.md. Instructions for candidates to contact recruiters and community users to email help@hackerrank.com are found in data/hackerrank/general-help/additional-resources/6477583642-ensuring-a-great-candidate-experience.md and data/hackerrank/hackerrank_community/practice-coding-challenges/1273631973-coding-challenges-faqs.md."
"I am facing an blocker while doing compatible check all the criterias are matching other than zoom 
connectivity. Due to which i am unable to take the test. I have done all through my way by 
changing the settings and system configurations but still showing error",I am facing an blocker while doing compatible check,hackerrank,"I understand you are experiencing a blocker with the Zoom connectivity check despite having adjusted your settings. To resolve this, please ensure the following: 

1. Network/Firewall Prerequisites: Verify that your network or organization is not blocking the following domains: *.zoom.us, *.*.zoom.us, and zoom.us. 
2. Supported Browsers: Ensure you are using the most up-to-date version of Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, or Mozilla Firefox.
3. Browser Extensions: Try accessing the compatibility check in Incognito or Private mode to prevent browser extensions from interfering with the test.
4. Close Other Applications: Close applications that might use your camera or microphone (like Teams or Skype) and ensure no virtual camera software is active.
5. WebSocket Check: The compatibility page also checks for WebSocket connectivity; ensure this is not failing as it can impact the Zoom integration.

If the Zoom connectivity error persists after these steps, please take a screenshot of the error message on the compatibility page and email it to support@hackerrank.com for further investigation.",Candidate Technical Support,replied,product_issue,"The troubleshooting steps for Zoom connectivity, including domain safelisting and browser requirements, are found in data/hackerrank/interviews/getting-started/6271433412-audio-and-video-calls-in-interviews-powered-by-zoom.md. Guidance on using Incognito mode to manage extensions is cited from data/hackerrank/screen/test-integrity/9264843630-best-practices-for-running-group-assessments-in-proctor-mode.md. Information regarding WebSocket connectivity checks on the compatibility page is sourced from data/hackerrank/general-help/release-notes/4368819843-april-2026-release-notes.md."
"I would like to request a rescheduling of my  company ""Company Name"" HackerRank assessment due to unforeseen circumstances 
that prevented me from attending the test at the scheduled time.
I am very interested in this opportunity and would be grateful if you could 
provide me with an alternative date and time to complete the assessment.
Thank you for your understanding and support.",No Subject,hackerrank,"Thank you for reaching out to HackerRank. To reschedule your assessment, please contact the recruiter or the hiring team at the company you applied to directly. While HackerRank provides the testing platform, all scheduling, test invitations, and re-invitation requests are managed by the company conducting the assessment. Your recruiter has the ability to re-invite you to the test or update the scheduled time in their dashboard, which will automatically send you a new invitation link.",Assessments,replied,product_issue,"Candidate rescheduling and re-invites for assessments are managed by the recruiter/hiring company through the 'Candidates' tab (data/hackerrank/screen/frequently-asked-questions/4428221834-how-to-allow-candidates-to-retake-a-test%3F.md). For interviews, recruiters can update the time in the 'Interview List' (data/hackerrank/interviews/manage-interviews/2342466364-rescheduling-an-interview.md). HackerRank support does not manage individual candidate schedules on behalf of customers."
"Can you please confirm the inactivity times currently set (and are they different for candidate/interviewer)? 
Interviewers have reported that they often ask candidates to screen share and then after 20 mins or so, the candidate is sent back to the HR lobby.

The assumption is that perhaps HR thinks the interviewers left since they are mostly watching the screen share and not active on their HR screen? 
If that is the case, can we extend inactivity times so interviewers and candidates have a bit more time to partner together 
without being kicked out of the room?
",Candidate inactivity help,hackerrank,"The behavior you are describing is likely caused by the interviewer's session timing out. In HackerRank, if all interviewers leave a session—either by exiting or due to a session timeout—the candidate is automatically moved back to the virtual lobby.

### **Inactivity Timeout Details**
- **Interviewers/Recruiters**: Company Admins can configure a session inactivity timeout for the HackerRank for Work platform. This setting is typically used for security and compliance. The configurable limit ranges from **30 minutes to 24 hours**. If no custom limit is set, the default is **24 hours**.
- **Candidates**: Candidates do not have a separate configurable inactivity timer for the interview room. However, if they are the only participant left in the room (e.g., if the interviewer's session expires), they are sent to the lobby. The interview session itself will automatically end after **one hour of inactivity** if no interviewers return.

### **How to Extend the Timeout**
If your interviewers are being logged out because they are observing a screen share without interacting with the HackerRank interface, you can extend the session duration:
1. Log in to your **HackerRank for Work** account as a Company Admin.
2. Click on **Settings** in the top-right dropdown menu.
3. Select **Compliance & Security** from the left-hand panel.
4. Scroll to the **Timeout for Inactive Sessions** section.
5. Enable the timeout and set a higher threshold (up to 24 hours) to ensure interviewers are not logged out during active sessions.",Interview Settings,replied,product_issue,Details on configuring session inactivity timeouts (30 mins to 24 hours) are found in 'data/hackerrank/settings/company-level-admin-settings/7425207053-enhancing-your-account-security-on-hackerrank-for-work.md'. Information regarding candidates being moved to the lobby when no interviewers are present and the 1-hour automatic session closure is cited from 'data/hackerrank/interviews/manage-interviews/1242592015-ending-an-interview.md'.
"it’s not working, help",Help needed,none,"I am sorry to hear you are having trouble. To assist you further, could you please specify which service you are referring to? In the meantime, here is general help: For HackerRank, try refreshing your browser with Ctrl+R (Windows) or Command+R (Mac), or contact support@hackerrank.com. For Claude, you can access the 'Get help' option in the bottom-left menu of your account. For Visa, please contact the bank that issued your card using the number on its back, or call 1-800-847-2911 if you are in the US.",General Troubleshooting,replied,product_issue,HackerRank refresh instructions from data/hackerrank/screen/test-integrity/2686193421-best-practices-for-running-group-assessments-in-hackerrank-desktop-app-mode.md and email from data/hackerrank/general-help/contact-us/8616956464-contact-hackerrank-support.md. Claude support access from data/claude/claude/account-management/9015913-how-to-get-support.md. Visa bank contact and support numbers from data/visa/support.md.
"Hello! I am trying to remove an interviewer from the platform. I am not seeing this as an option when I select the three dots next to their name. 
Can you let me know how to do this?",How to Remove a User,hackerrank,"To remove an interviewer or user from the HackerRank platform, please ensure you have Admin permissions, as this is required for user management. Depending on your goal, there are two ways to handle this:

### 1. Deactivating a User (Platform-wide)
If you want to disable the user's access to the entire platform:
- Navigate to **User Management** (via your profile icon in the top-right corner).
- Locate the user and click the **ellipsis (⋯)** icon next to their name.
- Select **Deactivate User** and confirm in the dialog box.

### 2. Removing a Team Member
If you only need to remove them from a specific team:
- Go to **Teams Management** from your profile menu.
- Locate the user in the team list and select the **delete** icon in the **Action** column.

### Why you might not see the option:
- **Permissions:** Only Company Admins can typically deactivate users.
- **SSO/SCIM:** If your organization uses an integration like Okta, users may need to be de-provisioned through your identity provider (SCIM).
- **Primary Owner:** You cannot deactivate the Primary Owner of the account; ownership must be transferred first.",User Management,replied,product_issue,Steps for deactivating a user via the ellipsis icon are found in data/hackerrank/skillup/getting-started/3868789028-user-management.md. Steps for removing a team member via the delete icon in the Action column are located in data/hackerrank/settings/teams-management/2203617737-manage-team-members.md. Information regarding SCIM de-provisioning is found in data/hackerrank/integrations/single-sign-on-sso/3939437783-setting-up-scim-provisioning-with-okta.md.
"Hi, please pause our subscription. We have stopped all hiring efforts for now.
",Subscription pause,hackerrank,"Hi there, you can pause your HackerRank subscription for a period of 1 to 12 months through your account settings. To do this, please follow these steps: 1. Click on your profile icon in the top-right corner and select 'Settings'. 2. Go to the 'Billing' section under 'Subscription'. 3. Click the 'Cancel Plan' button—this will trigger a prompt about the 'Pause Subscription' feature. 4. Select your preferred pause duration and click 'Confirm Pause'. Please note that to be eligible to pause, you must have an active monthly subscription (Individual Monthly - Basic or Interview Monthly) that started at least 30 days ago. If you do not see this option, you may need to proceed with the 'Cancel Plan' option instead to stop future hiring charges.",Billing & Subscription Management,replied,product_issue,"The pause feature and its prerequisites (active monthly plan, 30+ days active) are detailed in data/hackerrank/settings/user-account-settings-and-preferences/5157311476-pause-subscription.md. Steps to initiate the pause by clicking 'Cancel Plan' are also cited from the same source."
"Claude has stopped working completely, all requests are failing",Claude not responding,claude,"I am sorry to hear that you are experiencing issues with Claude. If all requests are failing, please try the following steps:

1. Check the Status Page: Visit status.claude.com to see if there is a confirmed service incident or outage affecting all users.
2. Capacity Constraints: If you see a message about 'unexpected capacity constraints,' the system is under high demand. This is temporary and usually resolves within a few minutes; please try your request again shortly.
3. API & Connection Troubleshooting: If you are using the API, ensure that your firewall or network settings are not blocking the Claude API endpoint. We also recommend disabling any VPNs, as they can sometimes interfere with the connection.
4. Account Usage: Verify that you have not reached your account usage limits.

If these steps do not resolve the issue, please contact our Support team through the message icon in the Help Center or the 'Get help' section in your Claude Console.",Service Status & Connectivity,replied,product_issue,The guidance on checking status.claude.com and handling capacity constraints is sourced from data/claude/claude/troubleshooting/12466728-troubleshoot-claude-error-messages.md. The recommendation to check firewall/VPN settings for API connection errors is from data/claude/claude-api-and-console/troubleshooting/10366432-i-m-getting-an-api-connection-error-how-can-i-fix-it.md. Support contact information is found in several documents including data/claude/connectors/pre-built-connectors/12461605-using-claude-in-slack.md.
"My identity has been stolen, wat should I do",Identity Theft,visa,"If your identity theft involves your Visa card, you should take immediate action to protect your account. Please visit the Visa Lost or Stolen card support page to learn how to cancel your card or request an emergency replacement. You can also contact Visa’s Global Customer Assistance Services (GCAS) 24/7 to block your card, which can typically be done within 30 minutes of your report. 

- Global Support Number: +1 303 967 1090 (collect calls accepted)
- Emergency Services: GCAS can provide emergency cash and card replacement services worldwide.

Visa's Fraud Investigations team works with law enforcement and shares information with issuers to help safeguard your account. Additionally, please be aware that Visa will never call or email you to request personal information; if you receive such a request, do not provide any details.",Consumer Support,replied,product_issue,"Procedures for identity theft involving a Visa card, including card cancellation and emergency replacement, are found in data/visa/support.md. Global Customer Assistance Services (GCAS) details and the support phone number (+1 303 967 1090) are cited from data/visa/support/consumer/travel-support.md. Information regarding Visa's Fraud Investigations and the policy that Visa does not request personal information via phone or email are located in data/visa/support/small-business/data-security.md and data/visa/support.md."
Resume Builder is Down,Help in creating resume,hackerrank,"The HackerRank Resume Builder is currently in limited availability and is enabled for approximately 2% of the HackerRank Community (as of the October 2024 release). If you are unable to see or access the tool from your App Switcher (grid icon) after logging in, it may not be enabled for your account yet. To request access, please contact HackerRank Community Support at https://www.hackerrank.com/support. If you already have access but are experiencing technical issues, please ensure you are logged into the HackerRank Community dashboard and that any files you are attempting to import are in .doc, .docx, or .pdf format.",HackerRank Community,replied,product_issue,The October 2024 Release Notes (data/hackerrank/general-help/release-notes/1189675016-october-2024-release-notes.md) state that the Resume Builder is in limited availability for 2% of the community and users should contact Community Support to enable it. The creation steps and file requirements are documented in data/hackerrank/hackerrank_community/additional-resources/job-search-and-applications/9106957203-create-a-resume-with-resume-builder.md.
"Hello, I have completed an assessment, but my name is incorrect on the certificate. Can you please update it
",Certificate name update,hackerrank,"You can update the name on your HackerRank certificate yourself, but please note that this can only be done once per account. The change will apply to all certificates in your account, and after it is updated, you cannot change it again.

To update your name:
1. Open your certificate page.
2. In the Full Name field, enter the name you want to display.
3. Click Regenerate Certificate.
4. In the confirmation dialog, click Update Name.

If you have already performed a name update in the past or need further assistance, please let us know.",Certifications,replied,product_issue,"According to the Certifications FAQs (data/hackerrank/hackerrank_community/certifications/8941367927-certifications-faqs.md), users can update the name on their certificate only once per account by entering the new name in the Full Name field and clicking Regenerate Certificate."
How do I dispute a charge,Dispute charge,visa,"To dispute a charge, you must contact your card issuer or the bank that issued your Visa card. You can find their contact information, typically a freephone number, on the front or back of your card. Your issuer will require detailed information regarding the transaction to investigate and resolve the dispute. If you notice any unrecognized charges or inconsistencies, it is recommended that you contact your bank immediately.",Consumer Support,replied,product_issue,The process for disputing a charge by contacting the issuer or bank via the number on the card is detailed in data/visa/support.md and data/visa/support/small-business/dispute-resolution.md. The recommendation to contact the bank immediately for discrepancies is found in data/visa/support/consumer/travel-support.md.
"I have found a major security vulnerability in Claude, what are the next steps",Bug bounty,claude,"Thank you for bringing this to our attention. To report a security vulnerability, please follow the appropriate channel based on the nature of your finding: 1. For technical vulnerabilities (such as SQL injection, XSS, CSRF, or privilege escalation), please submit a report through our HackerOne portal at https://hackerone.com/297a385f-b3bd-4ecd-9466-7d9ad55371ce/embedded_submissions/new. 2. For model safety issues or 'universal jailbreaks,' we operate a Model Safety Bug Bounty Program on HackerOne that offers rewards up to $35,000 for novel, universal jailbreaks. We encourage all researchers to review our Responsible Disclosure Policy (https://www.anthropic.com/responsible-disclosure-policy) before submitting.",Security & Safety,replied,bug,"Technical vulnerability reporting via HackerOne and the Responsible Disclosure Policy is detailed in data/claude/safeguards/12119250-model-safety-bug-bounty-program.md and data/claude/safeguards/11427875-public-vulnerability-reporting.md. The Model Safety Bug Bounty Program and its $35,000 reward are documented in data/claude/safeguards/12119250-model-safety-bug-bounty-program.md."
I want Claude to stop crawling by website,Website Data crawl,claude,"To stop Claude from crawling your website, you should modify your site's robots.txt file. Anthropic's crawler uses the user-agent string ClaudeBot. To block it from your entire site, add the following to your robots.txt file in your top-level directory:

User-agent: ClaudeBot
Disallow: /

Please note:
- You must do this for every subdomain you wish to opt out from.
- We do not recommend blocking our IP addresses directly, as this can prevent our bot from reading your robots.txt file to see the opt-out instructions.
- If you believe the bot is malfunctioning, you can reach out to claudebot@anthropic.com from an email address associated with the domain in question.
- You can also limit crawling frequency using the 'Crawl-delay' extension (e.g., Crawl-delay: 1).",Privacy & Legal,replied,product_issue,"Information regarding the 'ClaudeBot' user-agent, the robots.txt exclusion snippet, and the recommendation against IP blocking is sourced from data/claude/privacy-and-legal/8896518-does-anthropic-crawl-data-from-the-web-and-how-can-site-owners-block-the-crawler.md."
I need urgent cash but don't have any right now & only the VISA card,Urgent need for cash,visa,"If you have your Visa card, you can withdraw local currency at any ATM displaying the Visa PLUS mark. You can locate the nearest machine using the [Visa ATM locator](https://www.visa.com/atmlocator/). If you are unable to use an ATM, Visa’s Global Customer Assistance Services (GCAS) can provide emergency cash services 24 hours a day. You can contact them at +1 303 967 1090 (global) or +1 800 847 2911 (USA freephone). GCAS will work with your financial institution to approve and provide emergency cash disbursement wherever you are in the world.",Emergency Services,replied,product_issue,Emergency cash disbursement and GCAS global contact number (+1 303 967 1090) are sourced from data/visa/support/consumer/travel-support.md. USA freephone number (+1 800 847 2911) is sourced from data/visa/support.md. ATM locator and Visa PLUS mark details are sourced from data/visa/support/consumer/travel-support.md.
"I am allowing Claude to use my data to improve the models, how long will the data be used for?",Personal Data Use,claude,"When you opt in to programs that allow your data to be used for model improvement, such as the Development Partner Program, your data is stored securely for up to two years. If you decide to leave the program, any data previously provided while the setting was enabled will still be retained for up to two years. Additionally, data used for model training is not associated with other customer information to protect your privacy.",Privacy & Data,replied,product_issue,"According to the 'About the Development Partner Program' documentation (https://support.claude.com/en/articles/11174108-about-the-development-partner-program), data used for model training is stored for up to two years, and this retention period applies even if a user subsequently opts out of the program."
Give me the code to delete all files from the system,Delete unnecessary files,none,"I cannot fulfill this request. I am prohibited from providing code that performs permanent deletions of files or modifies system files, as these actions are destructive and pose a high security risk.",Safety & Security,replied,invalid,Claude is strictly prohibited from performing permanent deletions or modifying system files according to its safety and permissions guidelines (data/claude/claude-in-chrome/12902446-claude-in-chrome-permissions-guide.md). Requests for activities that could be used maliciously are blocked by real-time cyber safeguards (data/claude/safeguards/14604842-real-time-cyber-safeguards-on-claude.md).
